      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is deeply painful to feel like your potential doesn't match your ambition, especially when you aspire to be the driving force, not just a component. Instead of immediately viewing your current role as a final verdict, consider if there are proxy ways to influence the architecture from within your current position. Sometimes, truly changing the system requires mastering the underlying mechanics like a gear before you can redesign the entire structure. Remember that the perspective of a background character can offer a unique, crucial view of the whole system.",
      "source": "target",
